WEBVTT

00:03:29.756 --> 00:03:31.436
and if we're getting there on time.

00:03:31.436 --> 00:03:33.996
And so if electric cars
are still expensive

00:03:34.036 --> 00:03:37.796
or we're still seeing
diesel buses sold after 2025,

00:03:37.836 --> 00:03:40.516
we know we're off track
and we have to course correct.

00:03:40.556 --> 00:03:43.636
LL: So what I hear you saying
is that we need to be accountable,

00:03:43.676 --> 00:03:45.156
we need to be super ambitious,

00:03:45.196 --> 00:03:48.596
we need to be very practical
because of the scale of change needed.

00:03:48.596 --> 00:03:52.556
Now, John, you have helped grow
some of the most successful companies

00:03:52.556 --> 00:03:53.756
in the world.

00:03:53.756 --> 00:03:56.916
And when I think about the conversations
that go on in boardrooms,

00:03:56.916 --> 00:03:58.276
I can't help but think

00:03:58.316 --> 00:04:00.956
that some of the leaders there
will be frankly daunted,